# Scenario 'mail_server_many': メールサーバ "かくにんしてから" with FOURTEEN mails on the fake POP3 server (mail_many01..14): the check screen numbers the mails 1..14 (two-digit
# numbers: 2E:MailServerMgr_DrawMailNumber, the "n / total" status counters of 29:MailServerStatus_FormatNumber_M2), mails are deleted / skipped (every third) and the run is
# ended at mail 14. Round 1 used five mails. Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # メール
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x5
wait 30
tap A                        # メールサーバ
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_notice
tap A                        # OK (first-use notice)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot server_menu
tap A                        # かくにんしてからけす
waitstable 60 max 600
shot check_confirm
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # 0でつうしんをはじめる
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1500
shot check_mail1
wait 1200
shot mail1
tap A
wait 900
shot mail2
tap A
wait 900
shot mail3
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot mail4
tap A
wait 900
shot mail5
tap A
wait 900
shot mail6
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot mail7
tap A
wait 900
shot mail8
tap A
wait 900
shot mail9
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot mail10
tap A
wait 900
shot mail11
tap A
wait 900
shot mail12
tap RIGHT
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot mail13
tap RIGHT x2
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot mail_end
tap A
wait 900
shot mail15
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot res1
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot res2
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
shot menu
